   Your fragility concern is justified, but **�?omost load-sensitive�?? is not established by these files**. `ANCHOR_CONTRAST` also depends on wall-clock timing, and the session helper has a synchronization weakness discussed below. There are multiple external observations, but only one currently distinguishes M5.

2. **The four different-predicate mutants are not a complete enumeration. Here is the one escaping reinstatement.**

