   **Source-level prediction: all 26 rows still pass.** I decoded the literal CP6 instruction words in the probe: every tested inten access has `opcode1 == 0`. The sole nonzero opcode1 instruction is `E_UNKNOWN`, with `opcode1=3, crn=9, crm=2`; it never reaches the edited arm and still dies through `unknown`.

