   [PRETABLE�?Ts channel entry](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/xscaleinten/killtable_20260911/PRETABLE.out:59) prescribes �?oexit 1 / trap vs r0 = 0x5a (marker).�?? [`RD15_SURVIVE`](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/xscaleinten/agy_xscale_witness_20260911.py:359) implements that observable.

